#: cheats.c:2805
msgid "Memory:"
msgstr "内存："

#: cheats.c:2805
msgid "Which memory to search. Work RAM is where most games keep lives, health and score; a Mega CD game can also use the CD's own memory, and a 32X game its SDRAM (the memory of the two SH-2 processors, codes 06aaaaaa:dd). Word RAM is searched in whichever mode the game has it (in its 1M mode only the half the main CPU has at that moment is seen). Changing it starts a new search."
msgstr "搜索哪一块内存。大多数游戏把生命、血量与分数保存在工作 RAM 中；Mega CD 游戏还可使用 CD 自带的内存，32X 游戏可用其 SDRAM（两个 SH-2 处理器的内存，代码 06aaaaaa:dd）。Word RAM 按其当前模式搜索（在 1M 模式下只能看到主 CPU 当时拥有的那一半）。更改此项会重新开始搜索。"

#: cheats.c:2806
msgid "Size:"
msgstr "大小："

#: cheats.c:2806
msgid "How big the value is: 1 byte (0 to 255: lives, ammo) or 2 bytes (0 to 65535: score, money). A 2-byte value is saved as two cheats. Changing it starts a new search."
msgstr "数值大小：1 字节（0 到 255：生命、弹药）或 2 字节（0 到 65535：分数、金钱）。2 字节的数值会保存为两条金手指。更改此项会重新开始搜索。"

#: cheats.c:2807
msgid "Compare:"
msgstr "比较："

#: cheats.c:2807
msgid "How to compare each remaining address with the last time you searched."
msgstr "如何将每个剩余地址与你上次搜索时比较。"

#: cheats.c:2808
msgid "Value:"
msgstr "数值："

#: cheats.c:2808
msgid "For \"Equal to Value\": the number the game shows now (lives, ammo ...)."
msgstr "用于“等于数值”：游戏当前显示的数值（生命、弹药……）。"

#: cheats.c:2809
msgid "Start over: remember the memory as it is now (do this first)."
msgstr "重新开始：记录当前的内存状态（请先做这一步）。"

#: cheats.c:2810
msgid "Keep only the addresses that match; repeat until a few are left. Available after a First Scan."
msgstr "只保留匹配的地址；重复直到只剩少数几个。首次扫描后可用。"

#: cheats.c:2811
msgid "The addresses left. The value is what is there now."
msgstr "剩余的地址。数值为当前的值。"

#: cheats.c:2812
msgid "A name for the cheat."
msgstr "金手指的名称。"

#: cheats.c:2813
msgid "Set to:"
msgstr "锁定为："

#: cheats.c:2813
msgid "The value the cheat keeps the address at (0 to 255, or up to 65535 with Size 2 bytes)."
msgstr "金手指将该地址锁定为的数值（0 到 255，或大小为 2 字节时最高 65535）。"

#: cheats.c:2814
msgid "Add the selected address to the Cheats list as a RAM cheat."
msgstr "将所选地址作为 RAM 金手指加入金手指列表。"

#: cheats.c:2822
msgid "Finds where a value (lives, health, ammo, or with Size 2 bytes a score) is kept. 1. First Scan. 2. Change it in the game (lose a life ...). 3. Choose Compare (and Value), click Next Scan; repeat until a few addresses are left. 4. Select one, type the value to hold in Set to, Add Cheat."
msgstr "找出某个数值（生命、血量、弹药，或大小为 2 字节时的分数）存放的位置。1. 首次扫描。2. 在游戏中改变它（例如失去一条命……）。3. 选择比较方式（及数值），点击“再次扫描”；重复直到只剩少数地址。4. 选中一个，在“锁定为”中输入要保持的数值，点击“添加金手指”。"

